  "html": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"27635\" class=\"elementor elementor-27635\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9f0fe9d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b9f0fe9d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-708266fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"708266fb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3ba0148 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"e3ba0148\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; in Jacksonville?&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">What Is a Social Media Agency</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> in Jacksonville?</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55890a65 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55890a65\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A <a href=\"/jacksonville-digital-marketing-services/social-media-agency/\">Jacksonville social media agency</a> runs your presence on Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok, YouTube — whichever platforms your audience actually uses — across both organic content and paid advertising. The work involves strategy, content creation, community management, paid campaigns, and reporting that ties social activity to actual business outcomes. Social media for a Jacksonville business should produce something measurable: enquiries, bookings, brand recall in the local market, or sales — not just follower counts and likes.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-598f9dfd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"598f9dfd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be3a7f45 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"be3a7f45\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b0c19a3 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"6b0c19a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Actually Delivers&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">What a Jacksonville Social Media Agency</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Actually Delivers</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ec5d1f8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ec5d1f8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Social media agencies vary significantly in scope. These are the components that separate a programme that produces business outcomes from one that simply produces posts.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ffd8a61 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ffd8a61\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e8c67ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"8e8c67ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPlatform Strategy and Audience Research\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tNot every Jacksonville business needs to be on every platform. A B2B engineering firm gets different value from LinkedIn than from TikTok; a Jacksonville restaurant gets different value from Instagram than from Twitter. The first job is identifying where your audience actually spends time and concentrating effort there rather than spreading thin across platforms that don't produce.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f1f4f4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"5f1f4f4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tContent Creation\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tQuality content is the largest single workload in social media. Photography, video, graphic design, copy — produced consistently, on brand, and tuned for each platform's native conventions. Jacksonville businesses that try to handle this in-house often run out of time and bandwidth; the most common failure mode is starting strong and posting less and less as the months progress.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10b7e228 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"10b7e228\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPaid Social Advertising\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tOrganic reach on most platforms is limited. Paid social — Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, sometimes TikTok Ads — extends content to people who aren't already following you and runs direct-response campaigns against specific business goals. Effective paid social in Jacksonville requires audience targeting, creative testing, and conversion tracking tied to leads or sales.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0931a01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"e0931a01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCommunity Management and Reporting\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tComments, messages, and reviews need responses, often within hours rather than days. Community management protects brand reputation and converts interested followers into customers. Reporting then ties everything together — what was published, what it produced in reach and engagement, and most importantly what it produced in measurable business outcomes.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-668cb943 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"668cb943\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49cb980d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"49cb980d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ea1d114 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"4ea1d114\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Requires a Local Approach&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">Why Social Media in Jacksonville</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Requires a Local Approach</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-daf3a065 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"daf3a065\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Jacksonville is a market where local matters. The city has distinct neighbourhoods, distinct cultural communities, and a strong local identity that national chains often fail to capture. A social media programme run from outside the market — with no understanding of Jacksonville&#8217;s local references, events, or audience preferences — tends to feel generic and underperform.</p><p>That doesn&#8217;t mean every post needs to mention Jacksonville explicitly. It means content should reflect the rhythms of the city: events the local audience actually attends, weather patterns that affect daily life, professional sports moments people care about, neighbourhood references that resonate. For consumer-facing Jacksonville businesses in particular, social content that feels local outperforms content that could have come from anywhere.</p><p>Jacksonville is also large enough and diverse enough that a single broad-brush content strategy rarely works. Social strategy that segments audience and tailors content to specific Jacksonville submarkets typically converts at higher rates than generic city-wide content.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-946d0e20 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"946d0e20\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-edecdea0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"edecdea0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dd7aa60e elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"dd7aa60e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Social Media Agency&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">What to Look For in a Jacksonville</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Social Media Agency</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e22bdf51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e22bdf51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Social media agencies are easy to find in Jacksonville. The questions below separate agencies that produce business results from agencies that produce activity reports.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fbba944 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3fbba944\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8205aa51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"8205aa51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReporting Tied to Business Outcomes\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEngagement metrics — likes, comments, shares — are leading indicators, not outcomes. The reporting that matters connects social activity to enquiries, bookings, or sales. Ask to see a sample report. If it focuses on follower growth and impressions without showing what the work produced for the business, that's the report you'll be receiving.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f7789d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"8f7789d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIn-House Content Production\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAgencies that outsource content to overseas freelancers or generic content mills tend to produce content that feels generic. Agencies with in-house content teams — designers, video editors, copywriters who actually understand your brand — produce better and more consistent work. Ask who is creating your content before signing.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6e48291 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"f6e48291\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPaid and Organic Capability Together\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSocial organic and social paid increasingly overlap. The agency running your organic social should also be running your paid social, because creative, targeting, and message all benefit from being coordinated. Splitting these between separate agencies typically produces inconsistent campaigns.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51569953 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"51569953\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVertical and Local Experience\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSocial media for a Jacksonville law firm has different requirements than social media for a Jacksonville restaurant or a B2B SaaS business. Ask for examples in your category. Local Jacksonville experience also matters — agencies that have run social campaigns for businesses across the Jacksonville market understand what tends to perform here versus what doesn't.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef488d19 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ef488d19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d033398 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4d033398\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec753e64 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"ec753e64\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Engagement Is Structured&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">How a Jacksonville Social Media</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Engagement Is Structured</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-169325d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"169325d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The engagement starts with a strategy phase: we look at your current presence on every platform, your competitors&#8217; social activity in Jacksonville, your audience research, and your business goals. The output is a documented strategy — which platforms, what content cadence, what role paid plays, and how everything is measured.</p><p>From there we move to production. Content is built in monthly batches, reviewed and approved by you in advance, then scheduled and published. Paid campaigns run alongside organic and are managed continuously — not set up once and left alone. Community management runs daily. Jacksonville-specific timing — local events, weather, sports moments — is built into the calendar rather than missed because no one was watching.</p><p>Monthly reporting ties everything together. We work month-to-month with no long-term lock-in. If the programme isn&#8217;t producing measurable business outcomes within a reasonable timeframe, you can leave — but the goal is keeping the engagement because the work is producing, not because of contracts.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6718d448 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6718d448\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23caf379 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"23caf379\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95efdadd elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"95efdadd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Like for Jacksonville Clients&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">What Social Media Results Look</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Like for Jacksonville Clients</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5fe7c73e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5fe7c73e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Outcomes vary by category and starting point — these are representative of what consistent, properly managed Jacksonville social media programmes produce over six to twelve months.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98e608d1 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"98e608d1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93a5f7b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"93a5f7b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLead Generation Through Direct Messages\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Jacksonville home services company started Instagram and Facebook from essentially zero. Six months of consistent strategy, weekly posting, and Reels content produced 15 to 20 qualified enquiries per month coming through direct messages — a lead source that didn't exist before, generated entirely through organic content.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-252a5125 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"252a5125\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPaid Social Lead Volume at Stable Cost\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Jacksonville B2B services firm built a Meta Ads programme targeting specific Jacksonville business audiences. Within 90 days, paid social was producing qualified leads at a cost per lead competitive with their existing Google Ads channel — adding a meaningful new source of pipeline without cannibalising existing channels.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bcf75a32 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"bcf75a32\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBrand Awareness in the Local Market\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Jacksonville consumer brand needed local awareness as a foundation for foot traffic and online sales. Twelve months of consistent Instagram and TikTok content focused on Jacksonville-specific moments and audiences moved aided brand awareness measurably and contributed to a 40% lift in direct-channel revenue over the same period.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4df18cfe elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"4df18cfe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReputation and Review Velocity\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Jacksonville multi-location service business had inconsistent reviews and limited social proof. A coordinated social and reputation programme — combining content, community management, and review-generation campaigns — produced a measurable lift in both review volume and average rating across all locations within nine months.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
